  ('ビバルデの丘', 'viewpoint', 36.079072, 138.159534, '別荘地近くの絶景展望エリア', 'seed_auto', '1obbGzQzQ-E', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8f/Nagano_Kirigamine_xl.jpg/960px-Nagano_Kirigamine_xl.jpg', 'SHori / CC BY 4.0 / Wikimedia Commons', 'commons'),
