  ('天橋立', 'viewpoint', 36.154394, 137.921820, 'ツーリングの目的地、日本三景の一つ', 'seed_auto', 'Vo7AW0jX1lc', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/52/Sasaga%2C_Matsumoto%2C_Nagano_Prefecture_399-0033%2C_Japan_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg/960px-Sasaga%2C_Matsumoto%2C_Nagano_Prefecture_399-0033%2C_Japan_-_panoramio_%286%29.jpg', 'kiwa dokokano / CC BY-SA 3.0 / Wikimedia Commons', 'commons'),
