  ('中之条ガーデンズ', 'viewpoint', 36.599801, 138.810824, '1000本の花桃が咲き誇る花桃の丘がある', 'seed_auto', 'CDaggu6lAhc', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Nakanojo_Gardens.jpg/960px-Nakanojo_Gardens.jpg', 'photo: Qurren (talk) Taken with Canon PowerShot G9 X / CC BY-SA 4.0 / Wikimedia Commons', 'commons'),
  ('奥四万湖', 'viewpoint', 36.701360, 138.784170, '吸い込まれるような四万ブルーが見られるスポット', 'seed_auto', 'CDaggu6lAhc', 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Shimagawa_Dam_lake.jpg/960px-Shimagawa_Dam_lake.jpg', 'Photographed by Qurren (talk), with IXY Digital 10 compact digital camera. / CC BY-SA 3.0 / Wikimedia Commons', 'commons')
